WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.534
Moscow is blaming key for

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:03.303
a strike on a strategic bridge

00:00:03.303 --> 00:00:04.938
known as the gate to Crimea.

00:00:04.938 --> 00:00:05.805
A Russian installed

00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:06.339
official

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:07.741
said the damage is forcing traffic

00:00:07.741 --> 00:00:10.176
to be temporarily rerouted

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:13.079
The Chun Ha Bridge connects Occupy Crimea

00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:15.448
and Russian held parts of Ukraine's

00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:16.950
southern her southern region.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:19.219
So far, no official comment from Kiev.

00:00:19.552 --> 00:00:20.120
Which has said

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:21.054
it wants to retake

00:00:21.054 --> 00:00:22.622
all of its occupied land.

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:23.857
Moscow annexed Crimea

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:26.126
from Ukraine back in 2014.

00:00:26.159 --> 00:00:27.293
CNN's Ben Wedeman joins us

00:00:27.293 --> 00:00:29.195
live in separate city Ukraine.

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:31.731
What have you learned about this, Ben?

00:00:33.133 --> 00:00:34.401
Well, what we understand,

00:00:34.401 --> 00:00:35.869
according to the

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:38.838
head of the Russian occupied zone region,

00:00:39.406 --> 00:00:41.241
that four missiles were fired

00:00:41.241 --> 00:00:42.275
at this bridge

00:00:42.275 --> 00:00:43.943
early Thursday morning

00:00:43.943 --> 00:00:46.546
and that one actually struck it,

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:48.581
causing a large crater.

00:00:48.782 --> 00:00:49.682
And as you said,

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:51.751
all traffic is now being diverted

00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:55.321
from this bridge on the eastern side

00:00:55.321 --> 00:00:57.557
of the line of the area

00:00:57.557 --> 00:01:00.326
that connects Crimea with Harrison.

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:02.462
Now, according to this official,

00:01:02.462 --> 00:01:04.531
they believe that what could have struck

00:01:05.098 --> 00:01:05.732
the bridge

00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:08.668
is one of these storm shadow missiles,

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:10.136
a long range

00:01:10.136 --> 00:01:10.804
cruise missile

00:01:10.804 --> 00:01:11.905
that has about

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:14.507
range of more than 250 kilometers.

00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:15.842
This is a missile

00:01:15.842 --> 00:01:19.012
jointly developed by France and the U.K.

00:01:19.612 --> 00:01:20.947
And it was just last month

00:01:20.947 --> 00:01:21.781
that Britain announced

00:01:21.781 --> 00:01:24.551
that it would be supplying the Ukraine

00:01:25.085 --> 00:01:26.853
with that missile.

00:01:26.853 --> 00:01:29.622
Now, as far as we can tell,

00:01:29.856 --> 00:01:31.224
the Ukrainians are being a bit

00:01:31.224 --> 00:01:33.093
mum about all of this.

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:34.327
CNN did contact

00:01:34.327 --> 00:01:36.296
someone with the intelligence service

00:01:36.296 --> 00:01:40.533
who said that that Ukraine will continue

00:01:40.733 --> 00:01:41.634
its security,

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:42.502
its intelligence,

00:01:42.502 --> 00:01:43.269
its military

00:01:43.269 --> 00:01:44.971
and also local resistance

00:01:44.971 --> 00:01:46.840
to try to expel the Russians

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:48.708
and bring Ukrainian control

00:01:48.708 --> 00:01:49.742
back to Crimea,

00:01:49.742 --> 00:01:52.946
since it was occupied in 2014.

00:01:53.446 --> 00:01:55.248
But he said that beyond that,

00:01:55.248 --> 00:01:55.682
their only

00:01:55.682 --> 00:01:59.319
comment is to be continued Max.

00:01:59.652 --> 00:01:59.886
Okay.

00:01:59.886 --> 00:02:01.421
Ben Wedeman in south reaching Ukraine.

00:02:01.421 --> 00:02:02.021
Thank you.

00:02:02.021 --> 00:02:02.922
Ukraine says

00:02:02.922 --> 00:02:04.124
its slow, grinding

00:02:04.124 --> 00:02:05.492
counter-offensive is showing

00:02:05.492 --> 00:02:07.427
noticeable success in the south.

00:02:07.427 --> 00:02:08.695
It posted this video

00:02:08.695 --> 00:02:09.395
reportedly showing

00:02:09.395 --> 00:02:11.464
Ukrainian strikes in the

00:02:11.464 --> 00:02:13.867
RIA sector on Wednesday.

00:02:13.867 --> 00:02:15.635
Ukraine says it destroyed the equivalent

00:02:15.635 --> 00:02:17.170
of three Russian companies

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:18.571
over the last day and its troops

00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:19.772
continue to advance

00:02:19.772 --> 00:02:21.207
Kiev also says it repelled

00:02:21.207 --> 00:02:22.542
multiple Russian attacks

00:02:22.542 --> 00:02:24.511
in the Donetsk region on Wednesday.

00:02:24.511 --> 00:02:25.411
But Russian President

00:02:25.411 --> 00:02:26.579
Vladimir Putin claims

00:02:26.579 --> 00:02:27.480
without evidence

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:28.014
that Ukraine

00:02:28.014 --> 00:02:29.482
has slowed down its offensive

00:02:29.482 --> 00:02:31.751
because it took serious losses.

00:02:31.751 --> 00:02:32.252
Ukraine says

00:02:32.252 --> 00:02:33.786
Russia is employing new tactics

00:02:33.786 --> 00:02:35.955
in its aerial strikes across the country.

00:02:35.955 --> 00:02:37.891
It says Russian operators fly

00:02:37.891 --> 00:02:39.259
drones and missiles

00:02:39.259 --> 00:02:40.293
along rivers

00:02:40.293 --> 00:02:42.395
to avoid Ukraine's air defenses.

00:02:42.395 --> 00:02:43.596
But as Fred Pleitgen reports,

00:02:43.596 --> 00:02:44.931
Ukrainian Navy ships

00:02:44.931 --> 00:02:46.666
are trying to counter that move

00:02:49.602 --> 00:02:51.638
Night after night, a common theme,

00:02:52.772 --> 00:02:54.040
Russian aerial attacks

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:55.441
on Ukraine's cities.

00:02:55.441 --> 00:02:57.710
Air defense viciously fighting back

00:02:58.311 --> 00:03:01.080
from land, the air and from the water.

00:03:02.182 --> 00:03:04.250
We got exclusive access to Ukrainian

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:05.552
Navy patrol boats

00:03:05.552 --> 00:03:07.921
that are part of that fight.

00:03:07.921 --> 00:03:08.755
The Ukrainian say

00:03:08.755 --> 00:03:10.323
the Russians offered to fly drones

00:03:10.323 --> 00:03:12.125
and even cruise missiles along rivers

00:03:12.125 --> 00:03:14.060
to avoid air defenses.

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:15.094
That's why boats like this

00:03:15.094 --> 00:03:17.564
one played important role in both cities.

00:03:17.664 --> 00:03:19.232
But also a critical infrastructure,

00:03:19.232 --> 00:03:19.933
saying

00:03:20.967 --> 00:03:21.668
the commander

00:03:21.668 --> 00:03:22.902
who only gave his name

00:03:22.902 --> 00:03:24.003
as Anton says

00:03:24.003 --> 00:03:25.271
air defense is a key

00:03:25.271 --> 00:03:27.006
component of their mission.

00:03:27.006 --> 00:03:29.876
Are you effective So I cannot answer that

00:03:29.876 --> 00:03:31.311
question of how effective we are,

00:03:31.311 --> 00:03:32.912
but so are we affected?

00:03:32.912 --> 00:03:34.380
I will say yes.

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:35.615
As Ukraine presses on

00:03:35.615 --> 00:03:36.449
with its counter

00:03:36.449 --> 00:03:38.117
offensive, Kiev acknowledges

00:03:38.117 --> 00:03:39.319
the Russians are putting up

00:03:39.319 --> 00:03:40.753
stiff resistance.

00:03:40.753 --> 00:03:43.122
Every yard of territory, hard fought.

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:44.924
We would certainly like

00:03:44.924 --> 00:03:45.959
to make bigger steps.

00:03:45.959 --> 00:03:46.559
The Ukrainian

00:03:46.559 --> 00:03:47.493
president says

00:03:47.493 --> 00:03:48.995
They are smaller than we want,

00:03:48.995 --> 00:03:50.897
but nevertheless, those who fight

00:03:50.897 --> 00:03:51.564
shall win.

00:03:52.532 --> 00:03:52.999
Moscow

00:03:52.999 --> 00:03:55.068
claiming they are repelling Ukraine's

00:03:55.068 --> 00:03:56.336
attempted advances.

00:03:56.336 --> 00:03:57.103
Russian President

00:03:57.103 --> 00:03:58.104
Vladimir Putin saying

00:03:58.104 --> 00:03:59.472
his troops are wearing

00:03:59.472 --> 00:04:01.741
the Ukrainians down.

00:04:01.941 --> 00:04:03.943
Currently, we're seeing a certain lull.

00:04:04.244 --> 00:04:05.545
It has to do with the fact

00:04:05.545 --> 00:04:06.179
that the enemy

00:04:06.179 --> 00:04:08.948
is suffering serious losses.

00:04:08.948 --> 00:04:09.983
The Ukrainians fear

00:04:09.983 --> 00:04:12.018
the Russians may try to infiltrate

00:04:12.018 --> 00:04:13.486
and destabilize cities

00:04:13.486 --> 00:04:15.588
like Kiev or smuggle weapons here.

00:04:16.489 --> 00:04:17.790
So the Navy crew searches

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:19.926
all boats and barges on the river

00:04:21.427 --> 00:04:22.328
in this search.

00:04:22.328 --> 00:04:24.130
It was an all clear

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:27.100
there, all megastores and all the

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:28.334
suspected vessels.

00:04:28.334 --> 00:04:29.469
In the meantime,

00:04:29.469 --> 00:04:30.870
we will be surrounding them

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:31.504
to make sure

00:04:31.504 --> 00:04:32.305
that nobody is going

00:04:32.305 --> 00:04:33.506
to leave the vessel that they have

00:04:33.506 --> 00:04:34.974
will not be under attack.

00:04:34.974 --> 00:04:35.508
Their work,

00:04:35.508 --> 00:04:37.243
they say, even more pressing

00:04:37.243 --> 00:04:39.512
after the recent destruction of the novel

00:04:39.512 --> 00:04:40.613
Kafka Dam,

00:04:40.613 --> 00:04:41.281
which the Russians

00:04:41.281 --> 00:04:43.182
and Ukrainians blame on each other.

00:04:43.182 --> 00:04:45.518
Syria is also a strategic object,

00:04:45.518 --> 00:04:46.786
especially now, as you can see,

00:04:46.786 --> 00:04:48.688
what happened in Moscow.

00:04:48.688 --> 00:04:49.922
So now you can understand

00:04:49.922 --> 00:04:52.792
how it is important to make it

00:04:53.026 --> 00:04:54.227
safe and secure a place.

00:04:55.194 --> 00:04:56.796
Fred Pleitgen, CNN, Kiev.

